WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.700
In Downloads, double-click the disk image
you downloaded.

2
00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:11.362
In the window that opens, drag Scry Sync
onto the Applications folder.

3
00:00:11.932 --> 00:00:19.006
Then open Applications, select Scry Sync,
and press Cmd O.

4
00:00:19.576 --> 00:00:24.145
macOS asks once about an app downloaded
from the Internet,

5
00:00:24.145 --> 00:00:27.138
and says Apple checked it. Click Open.

6
00:00:27.708 --> 00:00:32.458
Scry Sync starts in the menu bar and shows
its sign-in window.
